      "scope": "Complete 19-page body and appendices, including Theorem2 pole cancellation, Corollary1, §5, polarity/inversion AppendicesA–C and low-period AppendicesD/E. Restored initially truncated middle via separate reads. Rendered actual PDF p9, journal p627.",
